-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack astrochem-0.10-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./astrochem-0.10-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/astrochem-0.10-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/astrochem-0.10-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libastrochem0-0.10-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libastrochem-devel-0.10-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-astrochem-0.10-X.tar.xz

